{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "What troubles you?", "hi": "आपको क्या तकलीफ़ है?", "r": "Uṅgaḷukku enna pirachchinai?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "உங்களுக்கு என்ன பிரச்சினை?"}, {"en": "Doctor, fever for two days.", "hi": "डॉक्टर, दो दिन से बुख़ार है।", "r": "Ṭākṭar, iraṇḍu nāṭkaḷāga kāychchal.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "டாக்டர், இரண்டு நாட்களாக காய்ச்சல்."}, {"en": "Any cough or cold?", "hi": "खाँसी-ज़ुकाम है?", "r": "Irumal, saḷi irukkiṛadā?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "இருமல், சளி இருக்கிறதா?"}, {"en": "Only a cough.", "hi": "सिर्फ़ ख़ाँसी है।", "r": "Irumal maṭṭum irukkiṛadu.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "இருமல் மட்டும் இருக்கிறது."}, {"en": "Don't worry. Take this tablet.", "hi": "घबराइए मत। यह गोली लीजिए।", "r": "Kavalai paḍādīrgaḷ. Inda māttiraiyai sāppiṭuṅgaḷ.", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "கவலைப்படாதீர்கள். இந்த மாத்திரையை சாப்பிடுங்கள்."}, {"en": "Thank you, doctor. Any diet restrictions?", "hi": "शुक्रिया डॉक्टर। कोई परहेज़?", "r": "Nanṛi ṭākṭar. Pattiyam ēdāvadu uṇḍā?", "sp": "Patient", "t": "நன்றி டாக்டர். பத்தியம் ஏதாவது உண்டா?"}], "title": "At the clinic"}, "lede": "Body, symptoms and the clinic — Tamil for staying well.", "phrases": [{"en": "I am not feeling well", "hi": "मेरी तबीयत ठीक नहीं है", "r": "Uḍambu sariyillai", "t": "உடம்பு சரியில்லை"}, {"en": "I have a fever", "hi": "मुझे बुख़ार है", "r": "Enakku kāychchal", "t": "எனக்கு காய்ச்சல்"}, {"en": "My head aches", "hi": "मेरे सिर में दर्द है", "r": "Talai valikkiṛadu", "t": "தலை வலிக்கிறது"}, {"en": "Call a doctor", "hi": "डॉक्टर को बुलाओ", "r": "Ṭākṭarai kūppiṭuṅgaḷ", "t": "டாக்டரை கூப்பிடுங்கள்"}, {"en": "Take me to hospital", "hi": "मुझे अस्पताल ले चलो", "r": "Ennai maruttuvamanaikku kūṭṭip pōṅgaḷ", "t": "என்னை மருத்துவமனைக்கு கூட்டிப் போங்கள்"}, {"en": "Where is the pharmacy?", "hi": "दवाख़ाना कहाँ है?", "r": "Marundagam eṅgē?", "t": "மருந்தகம் எங்கே?"}, {"en": "Take this medicine", "hi": "यह दवा लो", "r": "Inda marundai sāppiṭuṅgaḷ", "t": "இந்த மருந்தை சாப்பிடுங்கள்"}, {"en": "Drink hot water", "hi": "गरम पानी पियो", "r": "Suḍu taṇṇīr kuḍiyuṅgaḷ", "t": "சுடு தண்ணீர் குடியுங்கள்"}, {"en": "Take rest", "hi": "आराम करो", "r": "Ōyveḍuṅgaḷ", "t": "ஓய்வெடுங்கள்"}, {"en": "Get well soon", "hi": "जल्दी ठीक हो जाओ", "r": "Sīkkiram guṇamaḍaiyuṅgaḷ", "t": "சீக்கிரம் குணமடையுங்கள்"}, {"en": "Open your mouth", "hi": "मुँह खोलो", "r": "Vāyait tiṛaṅgaḷ", "t": "வாயைத் திறங்கள்"}, {"en": "Breathe deeply", "hi": "गहरी साँस लो", "r": "Āḻamāga mūchchuviḍuṅgaḷ", "t": "ஆழமாக மூச்சுவிடுங்கள்"}], "quiz": [{"a": "fever", "explain": "காய்ச்சல் (kāychchal) = fever — எனக்கு காய்ச்சல் (I have a fever).", "id": "tm-25", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["fever", "cough", "cold", "pain"], "q": "காய்ச்சல் means…", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "மருத்துவர்", "explain": "மருத்துவர் (maruttuvam) — மருந்து = medicine.", "id": "tm-26", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["மருத்துவர்", "செவிலியர்", "நோயாளி", "மருந்தாளுநர்"], "q": "Which is 'doctor'?", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "I am not feeling well", "explain": "உடம்பு சரியில்லை — உடம்பு = body.", "id": "tm-27", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["I am not feeling well", "I have a fever", "take rest", "get well soon"], "q": "'உடம்பு சரியில்லை' means…", "topic": "health", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "மருந்தகம் எங்கே?", "explain": "மருந்தகம் எங்கே? — எங்கே = where.", "id": "tm-28", "lesson": "health", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["மருந்தகம் எங்கே?", "மருத்துவமனை எங்கே?", "டாக்டர் எங்கே?", "வீடு எங்கே?"], "q": "Ask where the pharmacy is. You say…", "topic": "health", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "heart", "explain": "இதயம் (idayam) = heart.", "id": "tm-29", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["heart", "lung", "stomach", "liver"], "q": "இதயம் means…", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "medical diet", "explain": "பத்தியம் (pattiyam) — the doctor's diet rules. Tamil patients ask: பத்தியம் உண்டா?", "id": "tm-30", "lesson": "health", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["medical diet", "home remedy", "herbal medicine", "first aid"], "q": "பத்தியம் means…", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "get well soon", "explain": "சீக்கிரம் குணமடையுங்கள் — சீக்கிரம் = soon.", "id": "tm-31", "lesson": "health", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["get well soon", "take rest", "drink hot water", "call a doctor"], "q": "'சீக்கிரம் குணமடையுங்கள்' means…", "topic": "health", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "வாயைத் திறங்கள்", "explain": "வாயைத் திறங்கள் = open your mouth — வாய் = mouth.", "id": "tm-32", "lesson": "health", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["வாயைத் திறங்கள்", "கண்ணை மூடுங்கள்", "கையை நீட்டுங்கள்", "எழுந்து நில்லுங்கள்"], "q": "The doctor says 'open your mouth'. She says…", "topic": "health", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "injection", "explain": "ஊசி (ūsi) — injection (also needle).", "id": "tm-33", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["injection", "tablet", "syrup", "ointment"], "q": "ஊசி means…", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "take rest", "explain": "ஓய்வெடுங்கள் — ஓய்வு = rest.", "id": "tm-34", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["take rest", "wake up", "breathe deeply", "walk daily"], "q": "'ஓய்வெடுங்கள்' means…", "topic": "health", "type": "meaning"}], "slug": "health", "title": "Health & doctor", "words": [{"en": "hospital", "hi": "अस्पताल", "r": "maruttuvamanai", "t": "மருத்துவமனை"}, {"en": "doctor", "hi": "डॉक्टर", "r": "maruttuvar", "t": "மருத்துவர்"}, {"en": "nurse", "hi": "नर्स", "r": "seviliyar", "t": "செவிலியர்"}, {"en": "patient", "hi": "मरीज़", "r": "nōyāḷi", "t": "நோயாளி"}, {"en": "pharmacy", "hi": "दवाख़ाना", "r": "marundagam", "t": "மருந்தகம்"}, {"en": "pharmacist", "hi": "फार्मासिस्ट", "r": "marundāḷunar", "t": "மருந்தாளுநர்"}, {"en": "surgeon", "hi": "सर्जन", "r": "aṛuvai maruttuvar", "t": "அறுவை மருத்துவர்"}, {"en": "dentist", "hi": "दंत चिकित्सक", "r": "pal maruttuvar", "t": "பல் மருத்துவர்"}, {"en": "eye doctor", "hi": "नेत्र चिकित्सक", "r": "kaṇ maruttuvar", "t": "கண் மருத்துவர்"}, {"en": "chil